How about my upperclassmen?
Come on. Make some noise!

46:45.366 --> 46:46.458
Yeah, Steve!

46:46.546 --> 46:49.886
Let me hear it from my seniors,
class of 2012!

46:54.687 --> 46:59.670
Now I want you guys to give it up for the
young and very talented Mr. Andrew Detmer.

47:02.387 --> 47:04.389
And you're on.
Come on, you all.

47:04.405 --> 47:06.852
What are you guys doing?
Let's go! Let's go, let's go!

47:06.966 --> 47:09.011
Are you playing a prank on your cousin?

47:10.786 --> 47:12.386
That's mean, Matt.

47:12.872 --> 47:13.889
Just watch.

47:17.460 --> 47:18.632
Really?

47:22.214 --> 47:24.012
Good luck!
What's he doing?

47:24.091 --> 47:26.560
Show us some talent!

47:30.082 --> 47:31.149
Nice, Matt.

47:37.938 --> 47:39.781
Fifty-two Pickup!
Pick them up!

47:40.775 --> 47:44.154
No way!

47:52.536 --> 47:54.197
Go, Andrew!

47:54.413 --> 47:56.507
What? What?

48:03.990 --> 48:05.575
Are they gonna walk on that?

48:05.577 --> 48:06.538
What do you think?

48:14.225 --> 48:16.819
He's got it.
He's got it. He's got it.

48:18.481 --> 48:19.633
Easy.

48:20.272 --> 48:21.774
Yeah, you got it.

48:22.650 --> 48:24.072
Holy crap!

48:25.152 --> 48:28.076
Yeah! Cakewalk!

48:28.155 --> 48:30.999
Give it up, give it up, give it up!

48:31.784 --> 48:35.630
Oh, my God.
Andrew is so amazing.

48:43.003 --> 48:45.306
Give it up! Let's go!

48:46.048 --> 48:47.813
Seriously, how are they doing this?

48:48.158 --> 48:49.316
I don't know.

48:50.386 --> 48:51.638
Magic.

48:56.602 --> 48:57.771
That was amazing!

48:58.093 --> 48:59.413
Yeah!

49:03.858 --> 49:05.059
Oh, my God.

49:05.121 --> 49:06.251
I. I can see...

49:06.652 --> 49:09.097
your head is like exploding right now.

49:09.099 --> 49:10.742
What?
This is the beginning of your downfall.

49:10.947 --> 49:12.908
Hubris. Right there.

49:13.868 --> 49:15.053
What's hubris?

49:15.964 --> 49:17.492
No, what does hubris mean, Matt?

49:17.821 --> 49:18.715
Seriously?

49:19.039 --> 49:20.680
What does seriously mean?

49:20.682 --> 49:21.512
What? I'm...

49:21.542 --> 49:24.152
Get in there.
Don't push me, dude. I'm going.

49:24.164 --> 49:26.420
Your fans await.
You're the man of the hour.

49:26.422 --> 49:27.906
Look at this house!

49:28.144 --> 49:28.878
Oh, sick!

49:28.880 --> 49:30.946
Dude, this place looks huge.
I know.

49:30.994 --> 49:32.166
It's enormous. Dude.

49:32.556 --> 49:33.900
Matt! Andrew!

49:33.929 --> 49:35.556
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Steve! Oh, my God!

49:35.681 --> 49:38.355
Everybody's freaking out. Come on, man.
Everybody's been waiting for you.

49:39.643 --> 49:41.486
V.I.P. coming through.
Coming through!

49:41.562 --> 49:43.564
Andrew Copperfield
coming through!

49:43.647 --> 49:45.695
Make way, make way.

49:46.734 --> 49:49.032
Matt, come this way.
Drew, over here.

49:50.571 --> 49:52.994
Andrew Detmer's in the house!

49:56.911 --> 49:57.983
How are you feeling?

49:57.985 --> 50:00.422
I'm... I'm... I'm doing good.

50:00.498 --> 50:01.881
Yeah? Are you sure?

50:02.123 --> 50:03.248
Are you sure?
Hey. Hey.

50:03.250 --> 50:04.172
Hello.
Andrew.

50:04.293 --> 50:05.936
Magic is so hot.

50:06.220 --> 50:06.960
Thanks.

50:07.149 --> 50:09.975
So, do you not remember me at all?

50:11.258 --> 50:12.461
Monica, right?
Yes!

50:12.505 --> 50:13.081
Monica.

50:13.093 --> 50:15.597
Setting the camera down.
I'm setting the camera down.

50:15.930 --> 50:16.597
What...

50:17.923 --> 50:18.982
Excuse me.

50:19.099 --> 50:20.476
Have you ever played that, over there?

50:22.554 --> 50:24.440
No. I have never
played that, over there.

50:24.471 --> 50:25.792
No?
Never.

50:26.023 --> 50:27.373
Never.
I bet you're good at it.

50:28.427 --> 50:30.313
What, you just throw the ball into the cups?
Yep.

50:30.315 --> 50:30.921
Yep.

50:30.945 --> 50:34.552
I... I actually could be good
at that right now.

50:34.554 --> 50:35.003
Yeah?

50:35.151 --> 50:36.448
Maybe.
Let's find out.

50:36.450 --> 50:37.724
No, no, no, no, no.
Come on!

50:37.726 --> 50:38.844
What?
Come on.

50:39.286 --> 50:40.663
Ok, ok.
Come on.

50:40.665 --> 50:41.879
Ok, I'm coming.
I'm coming.

50:41.881 --> 50:42.997
There you are.

50:47.503 --> 50:48.720
Amazing.

50:48.796 --> 50:50.719
That's what I'm talking about.

51:09.016 --> 51:10.624
Hey, where is Andrew anyway?

51:13.070 --> 51:15.783
Andrew's upstairs with the girl
with the pink hair.

51:16.240 --> 51:17.958
What, like, they went together?

51:18.033 --> 51:20.374
That's my boy,
of course they went together.

51:20.376 --> 51:21.254
What are you talking about?

51:21.401 --> 51:23.671
Hey, Andrew.
I hope you're seeing this.

51:23.843 --> 51:25.592
Congratulations, sir.

51:25.833 --> 51:27.739
I just, I wanted you to know, dude...

51:27.856 --> 51:31.426
I mean I was really worried about you
before all this, you know?

51:31.659 --> 51:32.384
But dude,

51:32.687 --> 51:35.245
things are gonna get
so much better for you now.

51:35.367 --> 51:37.281
I really, really feel that.

51:37.845 --> 51:40.589
And I want you to know
I love you, you know?

51:40.806 --> 51:41.970
I love you, man.

51:42.428 --> 51:43.479
It's you and me.

51:43.729 --> 51:45.178
It's Detmer and Garetty,

51:45.180 --> 51:47.995
extended family for life.

51:48.689 --> 51:50.737
Oh, sorry. Sorry.
No man, excuse yourself.

51:54.236 --> 51:55.436
Oh, man.

51:56.030 --> 51:58.735
When did I become the
one who's out here...

51:59.150 --> 52:00.356
Hey, Matt.
Filming myself?

52:00.409 --> 52:01.302
Hey, hey?

52:01.531 --> 52:02.932
Hey, hey Casey.

52:03.579 --> 52:04.984
So what are you filming?

52:06.314 --> 52:07.372
It's just a thing.

52:07.374 --> 52:09.968
It's not like
eye of the storm or anything.

52:10.044 --> 52:11.483
Hey, I wanted to...

52:11.966 --> 52:13.390
I wanted to tell you...

52:13.464 --> 52:15.887
I've really been...
it's been making me think a lot.

52:15.966 --> 52:18.310
I've been kind of
thinking about it in my...

52:18.708 --> 52:20.131
No, I have. Like in my life.

52:20.133 --> 52:23.021
Like I've been thinking if I applied
myself what I could do.

52:23.099 --> 52:25.223
You know I could really,
I could change the world.

52:25.225 --> 52:27.591
I mean, it's really been...
You're drunk.

52:28.052 --> 52:29.009
What?

52:30.984 --> 52:32.070
Hey, Casey?

52:32.072 --> 52:36.322
I've basically been stalking you
since like sophomore year.

52:36.779 --> 52:38.541
Sorry, use of the word stalking.

52:38.543 --> 52:40.315
I shouldn't have said...
You want to get out of here?

52:41.950 --> 52:43.202
Yeah.
Yeah?

52:43.363 --> 52:44.724
Yes. Yes, definitely.

52:44.870 --> 52:47.726
I. I. I have to drop off
the camera first though.

52:51.168 --> 52:54.798
Ok, you guys are getting ready
to witness history, alright?

52:54.880 --> 52:57.759
I'm like a proud dad right now
because behind these doors,

52:57.841 --> 53:00.357
Andrew Detmer becomes a man.

53:02.680 --> 53:04.636
He's a little boy behind there.
He's scared.

53:04.690 --> 53:06.443
He's like a butterfly,
getting ready to emerge...

53:06.482 --> 53:07.238
Oh, God!

53:07.240 --> 53:09.240
From a cocoon or some shit like that.

53:09.281 --> 53:10.646
Disgusting weirdo!

53:10.813 --> 53:12.544
Wait. What? What happened?

53:12.560 --> 53:13.055
Ok.

53:13.172 --> 53:14.976
Is that...
Out of my way now!

53:14.992 --> 53:17.166
Oh, man.
Monica, what happened?

53:17.245 --> 53:20.422
Drew! Drew! It's ok, man.
Don't worry about it.

53:20.424 --> 53:22.154
Look, it happens to the best of us, ok?

53:22.216 --> 53:23.739
Dude you had a little too much to drink...

53:26.232 --> 53:26.878
Buddy.

53:27.181 --> 53:28.970
The hell's going on, dude?
Why are you laughing?

53:29.076 --> 53:30.447
Man, all over my jacket.

53:30.478 --> 53:32.965
Stop. Stop laughing.
What are you talking about?

53:32.967 --> 53:35.797
It's cool, man.
No, it's not cool, Steve. Stop.

53:36.158 --> 53:38.765
Stop what? It's cool, man.
Will you just get out of here?

53:38.882 --> 53:39.694
Get out!

53:39.696 --> 53:40.856
Drew, Drew!
What's your problem?

53:40.879 --> 53:42.736
You think this is funny?
No, I'm not laughing...

53:42.762 --> 53:43.729
Get out!

54:17.588 --> 54:18.759
Dad!

54:19.883 --> 54:22.578
Andrew! Please!

54:22.580 --> 54:24.392
I need my medicine.

54:24.470 --> 54:27.503
Mom's in pain, alright?
She needs her pills!

54:27.505 --> 54:28.375
Where are you?

54:32.000 --> 54:33.230
Where are you?

54:39.979 --> 54:40.901
Dad!

54:40.903 --> 54:42.984
Hoarding a $500 camera,

54:43.056 --> 54:44.510
while your mom dies in there?

54:44.699 --> 54:46.543
I mean, how selfish can you be?

54:50.954 --> 54:52.456
I went through your camera.

54:54.875 --> 54:56.120
What did you see?

54:57.878 --> 54:59.497
Just you being a loser.

55:01.215 --> 55:03.217
You think that those people
are your friends?

55:05.367 --> 55:06.354
They're not.

55:06.553 --> 55:08.186
You're an embarrassment.

55:09.097 --> 55:10.550
You're running around this town,

55:10.745 --> 55:12.037
spending my money.

55:12.426 --> 55:13.980
Look at me when I'm talking to you!

55:13.982 --> 55:16.102
I didn't spend any
of your money, Richard.

55:16.104 --> 55:18.804
Because I don't have a dime to spend.

55:19.191 --> 55:21.481
Every last cent...
Look at me!

55:21.819 --> 55:24.753
Every last cent goes to school for you.
School?

55:24.755 --> 55:26.452
And medication for your mother.
I go to a public school!

55:26.454 --> 55:29.150
And I can't even pay for a goddamn...
You don't pay for a public school, you idiot!

55:31.328 --> 55:32.659
What did you call me?

55:33.121 --> 55:34.839
Did you call me an idiot, you shit?

55:34.915 --> 55:36.220
Did you call me an idiot?

55:38.085 --> 55:39.712
You piece of shit!

55:39.795 --> 55:42.775
Get up.
I said get up!

55:43.006 --> 55:43.645
Get up!

55:47.928 --> 55:49.726
I could crush you, you know that?
Stop it!

55:49.805 --> 55:52.354
Crush you!
Get...

56:19.793 --> 56:20.976
Smile, Matt.

56:21.545 --> 56:22.728
Oh, my God, Matt.

56:23.422 --> 56:26.048
Can we not do the camera thing
right now, please?

56:26.300 --> 56:27.395
What happened?

56:29.695 --> 56:31.401
It just started out of nowhere.

56:31.972 --> 56:33.089
Are you ok?

56:34.308 --> 56:35.824
My head hurts really bad.

56:37.728 --> 56:40.358
That's probably Steve
calling your cell again.

56:40.529 --> 56:41.448
I'll call him back later.

56:41.892 --> 56:43.363
I think it's time to take later...

56:43.763 --> 56:45.503
Matt! Matt! Come on!

56:45.558 --> 56:46.999
Matt! Give me my...
I did not expect this.

56:55.495 --> 56:57.936
Hey! Hey, asshole!

56:58.248 --> 56:59.625
Hey! What are you doing up here?

56:59.744 --> 57:01.618
Just leave me alone, Steve!

57:01.751 --> 57:03.838
You can't be up here, dude.
This isn't safe.

57:04.022 --> 57:05.803
I don't want to talk to anyone.

57:05.835 --> 57:07.759
Bro! What are you doing up here?

57:07.957 --> 57:09.437
Leave me alone!

57:10.489 --> 57:12.215
How did you find me?

57:13.095 --> 57:15.357
I don't know, man.
My nose was bleeding.

57:15.432 --> 57:16.979
I heard your voice or something like...

57:17.059 --> 57:18.902
What the hell
happened to your face?

57:19.240 --> 57:21.083
Nothing, man.
Just leave me alone.

57:21.085 --> 57:23.571
No, dude, that's not nothing.
That... Your dad!

57:23.680 --> 57:25.103
Your dad beat the shit out of you.

57:25.105 --> 57:26.323
He can't do that to you now.

57:26.347 --> 57:28.529
Will you stop acting
like you give a shit?

57:28.612 --> 57:29.340
Dude.

57:29.976 --> 57:32.292
Why are you talking to me like this?
I'm your best friend.

57:32.308 --> 57:33.951
I don't have any friends!

57:34.034 --> 57:36.194
You were never my friend
before any of this.

57:36.280 --> 57:38.509
I hang out with you and Matt,
like every day!

57:39.105 --> 57:41.369
We're supposed to fly around
the world together. Don't you...

57:41.371 --> 57:42.627
Do you remember that?

57:43.043 --> 57:45.466
You think I'm...
Stop! Just stop talking to me!

57:45.587 --> 57:47.806
Why won't you just leave me alone?
Come on, man.

57:47.881 --> 57:50.259
Steve, I'm telling you,
get away from me!

57:50.342 --> 57:51.901
Get away from me now!

57:52.205 --> 57:52.973
Please!

58:28.171 --> 58:31.519
Who, by the power of God,
are safeguarded in faith.

58:32.202 --> 58:34.333
Even though you do not see him now,

58:34.886 --> 58:38.390
you rejoice with an indescribable
and glorious joy...

58:39.099 --> 58:41.443
as you attain the goal of your faith...

58:41.518 --> 58:43.441
the salvation of your soul.

58:45.605 --> 58:47.550
What are you doing?
You filming graves?

58:49.026 --> 58:49.971
I don't get it.

58:49.973 --> 58:51.248
What do you care?

58:51.611 --> 58:54.205
You haven't been returning my calls.
Why aren't you returning my calls?

58:54.990 --> 58:56.643
I've been busy.
No, you haven't.

58:56.645 --> 58:57.900
Why aren't you returning my calls?

58:58.188 --> 58:59.690
I just don't feel like talking.

58:59.745 --> 59:00.761
Turn off the camera.

59:01.127 --> 59:01.833
No.

59:01.881 --> 59:04.009
Andrew.
Andrew, turn off the camera.

59:05.125 --> 59:05.803
Andrew?

59:06.361 --> 59:07.539
How did he get struck by lightning

59:07.541 --> 59:09.794
during a storm with no
recorded lightning strikes?

59:11.135 --> 59:11.805
How?

59:12.299 --> 59:14.267
And they found Steve
out in the middle of a field.

59:14.543 --> 59:17.657
Why would Steve go out in the middle of
a field during a lightning storm, Andrew?

59:17.673 --> 59:18.720
I don't know.
Why? What?

59:18.722 --> 59:20.395
I don't know what happened, Matt!
What?

59:20.528 --> 59:22.206
I don't believe you, ok?
I don't believe you.

59:22.208 --> 59:24.010
I want you to turn off
the camera and talk to me.

59:24.105 --> 59:24.620
Why?

59:24.651 --> 59:27.235
Because I want to have a conversation with you ok.
Don't tell me what to do, Matt.

59:27.237 --> 59:28.920
You can't tell me what to do, Matt.
You just turn your camera off.

59:28.921 --> 59:29.746
Andrew. Shut it off!
Don't ever tell...

59:29.748 --> 59:31.652
Give me. Shut it off!
Get off of me!

59:35.489 --> 59:36.350
Andrew.

59:36.809 --> 59:37.858
Are you joking right now?

59:37.860 --> 59:39.395
Is this a joke to you?

59:39.967 --> 59:40.758
I...

59:46.792 --> 59:47.957
What did you do, Andrew?

59:48.618 --> 59:49.668
What did you do?

59:51.129 --> 59:52.907
Who am I supposed
to tell about this?

59:52.909 --> 59:55.752
Who do I talk to?
Who do I talk to about this?

59:56.043 --> 59:58.888
Why won't you just tell me
what happened, Andrew?

01:00:12.118 --> 01:00:13.991
Please believe me, Steve.

01:00:15.195 --> 01:00:16.550
Please, it's just I...

01:00:17.596 --> 01:00:19.098
I don't know what I did. I...

01:00:19.499 --> 01:00:21.527
I lost control, and...

01:00:22.347 --> 01:00:24.100
and I'm so sorry.

01:00:25.871 --> 01:00:26.974
This thing...

01:00:27.499 --> 01:00:29.244
is just becoming a part of me now,

01:00:29.420 --> 01:00:30.241
and I don't...

01:00:32.426 --> 01:00:33.765
I miss you, Steve.

01:01:46.046 --> 01:01:46.818
Andrew!

01:01:49.398 --> 01:01:50.439
Dry off!

01:01:55.170 --> 01:01:56.319
Hey, Wayne!

01:02:03.334 --> 01:02:04.291
Ok, so...

01:02:05.048 --> 01:02:06.204
see this one here?

01:02:06.943 --> 01:02:09.523
This one I got really clean
because I did this little like...

01:02:10.132 --> 01:02:12.494
lasso thing around the root,
you know?

01:02:13.021 --> 01:02:14.249
But then these two...

01:02:14.896 --> 01:02:15.947
these...

01:02:16.402 --> 01:02:17.837
I did not get as good.

01:02:18.485 --> 01:02:19.929
See how they're broken?

01:02:20.570 --> 01:02:22.719
I think it's because
I got them from the middle,

01:02:22.721 --> 01:02:23.962
you know, instead of the root.

01:02:28.480 --> 01:02:29.572
Sloppy.

01:02:29.704 --> 01:02:32.503
I've been doing a lot of reading,
you know, like online about like...

01:02:32.716 --> 01:02:34.607
just like evolution and like...

01:02:34.685 --> 01:02:35.833
and natural selection...

01:02:35.916 --> 01:02:37.984
and how like,
there is this thing, right?

01:02:38.275 --> 01:02:41.028
It is called the apex predator, right?

01:02:41.051 --> 01:02:42.521
And basically what this is,

01:02:42.523 --> 01:02:45.895
is the strongest animal
in the ecosystem, right?

01:02:45.897 --> 01:02:48.145
And, and as human beings,

01:02:48.387 --> 01:02:50.766
we are, we're considered
the apex predator,

01:02:50.768 --> 01:02:54.052
but only because, like smaller
animals can't feed on us,

01:02:54.059 --> 01:02:55.605
because of weapons and stuff, right?

01:02:55.689 --> 01:02:59.899
The lion does not feel guilty
when it kills a gazelle, right?

01:03:00.627 --> 01:03:03.058
You do not feel guilty
when you squash a fly.

01:03:05.833 --> 01:03:07.649
And I think that means something.

01:03:09.930 --> 01:03:11.920
I just think that really means something.

01:03:21.881 --> 01:03:24.655
This one I got really
clean because I did this little, like,

01:03:24.884 --> 01:03:26.224
lasso thing.

01:03:31.701 --> 01:03:33.385
Andrew, what happened at school?

01:03:34.811 --> 01:03:36.639
I need to go and pick up
my mom's medication!

01:03:36.641 --> 01:03:37.194
Oh, yeah?
Ok.

01:03:37.240 --> 01:03:38.540
You're gonna break the rules again?

01:03:38.542 --> 01:03:40.403
We're too strong for that now, Andrew!

01:03:40.405 --> 01:03:41.276
If you did that,

01:03:41.278 --> 01:03:42.697
you know what I'd have to do!
You'd have to what?

01:03:42.699 --> 01:03:44.567
You have to start thinking Andrew ok?
What would you have to do, Matt?

01:03:44.590 --> 01:03:46.982
There are consequences to what you do!
You could not do anything to me

01:03:46.984 --> 01:03:48.973
Stop that bullshit! Andrew!
Because I am stronger than you Matt.

01:03:49.002 --> 01:03:50.736
I know what you did.
I'm not gonna let you do it again!

01:03:50.738 --> 01:03:52.709
I am not going to break your stupid rules!

01:03:52.912 --> 01:03:53.483
Ok?

01:03:54.031 --> 01:03:57.224
So just screw off and stay out of my life!

01:04:29.307 --> 01:04:30.568
I can't breathe.

01:04:34.980 --> 01:04:36.482
Thank you.

01:04:39.070 --> 01:04:41.814
Karen Detmer.
Just one moment.

01:04:43.768 --> 01:04:45.987
We're gonna need a next day delivery.

01:04:46.007 --> 01:04:49.932
Co-pay on that is $750.83.

01:04:50.053 --> 01:04:51.581
Well, I don't have all that.

01:04:51.639 --> 01:04:53.356
Son, I told your dad, and I'll tell you.

01:04:53.470 --> 01:04:56.223
You can pay up front, and we
can order next day delivery.

